# frameeyeosc settings, read from ~/.config/frameeyeosc/env (install.sh creates it from this file).
# Apply changes with: systemctl --user restart frameeyeosc    Options: frameeyeosc --help
# Settings can also live in ~/.config/frameeyeosc/config.json (the panel writes it), which is picked
# up while running. Options given here win over that file and cannot be changed from the panel.
# With no options, OSC goes to the PC that Steam Link is streaming from (port 9000), and each
# eye's relaxed openness is learned while you use it (saved to ~/.config/frameeyeosc/calibration).
# Examples:
#   FRAMEEYEOSC_ARGS="--lid-scale-right 1.06"          # fix the right eye's multiplier instead of learning it
#   FRAMEEYEOSC_ARGS="--target 192.168.1.10:9000"      # fixed destination instead of auto
FRAMEEYEOSC_ARGS=""
